# Dotfiles local configuration (EXAMPLE)
#
# Copy this file to your machine-local config path (OUTSIDE this repo) and edit:
#
#   mkdir -p ~/.config/dotfiles
#   cp config/dotfiles/local.env.example ~/.config/dotfiles/local.env
#   $EDITOR ~/.config/dotfiles/local.env
#
# The setup/clone/doctor scripts source ~/.config/dotfiles/local.env when it
# exists and fall back to portable generic defaults when it does not. This file
# is a documented template only — keep real values in the copy under
# ~/.config, never in the repo. Do NOT put secrets/tokens in this repo.
#
# Override the path with DOTFILES_LOCAL_ENV=/path/to/local.env if you prefer.

# --- Git identity ------------------------------------------------------------
# When set, `./dot setup mac|linux` writes these to ~/.config/git/local.gitconfig
# (included by the tracked .gitconfig) instead of prompting. The public .gitconfig
# ships no identity on purpose.
# DOTFILES_GIT_NAME="Your Name"
# DOTFILES_GIT_EMAIL="you@example.com"

# --- Repo workstream buckets -------------------------------------------------
# Space-separated bucket dirs created under ~/github_repos and recognized as
# the optional first field in repos.txt. Default: "personal ventures external".
# Add your own contexts (e.g. an employer or client codename) here.
# DOTFILES_REPO_BUCKETS="personal ventures external clientx"

# Where repos are cloned (default: ~/github_repos).
# GITHUB_REPOS_DIR="$HOME/github_repos"

# --- Pi agent scaffold (optional) --------------------------------------------
# Local checkout of the memory compiler used by the optional Pi memory-compiler
# extension. NOTE: this file is sourced by the dotfiles repo scripts, not by the
# Pi runtime. The extension reads this value only from its own process
# environment or from ~/.pi/agent/memory-compiler.json. To make it take effect
# for Pi, export it in your shell rc or set "compilerDir" in that JSON file.
# Default: ~/github_repos/personal/claude-memory-compiler.
# PI_MEMORY_COMPILER_DIR="$HOME/github_repos/personal/claude-memory-compiler"

# Extra secret/private-string regexes for `./dot pi doctor` to reject in the Pi
# scaffold, one per line, in a separate gitignored file. Keep the real private
# endpoint/token patterns here, out of the public repo. Default path:
#   ~/.config/dotfiles/pi-scaffold-blocklist.txt
# DOTFILES_PI_BLOCKLIST="$HOME/.config/dotfiles/pi-scaffold-blocklist.txt"
